       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CARDDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY CARDREC.
       01 WS-DECISION             PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
       01 WS-RISK-SCORE           PIC 9(03) VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 42 TO WS-RISK-SCORE
           IF CARD-STATUS = 'A' AND WS-RISK-SCORE < 70
               MOVE 'APPROVED' TO WS-DECISION
           ELSE
               MOVE 'REVIEW' TO WS-DECISION
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'CARD DECISION: ' WS-DECISION
           GOBACK.
